<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai authorities are holding informal border talks with Cambodia to implement a truce and seek public input on southern peace negotiations, while simultaneously rejecting Cambodia's claims over border barriers and displaced residents. The government is promoting cross-border tourism with road-trip packages, a new travel guidebook, and a 15‑day visa-free scheme for three countries, alongside digital border passes at Mae Sai. A Thai transwoman was detained after stabbing a postgraduate student, and the army is targeting an alleged cross-border money-laundering network, freezing over 26 billion baht in assets. Trade cooperation with Malaysia aims for US$30 billion by 2027, and the EU is supporting de-mining efforts along the border. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPUm16ektzVmIwM2lsSEdWX2Z2eEp2VUdDVTAwOU4zOWg3THZwa0pnZDFUWEdUY3ZibVhWS01XUUxmdU1qRzhJU0pHai1KTzR4T3A1REhYNFNxdHNIRW1mbHVRVHRxay1ZR1hnbjQ5VHhHbHhDTVZVM0ZlWlhJUURlZWpvLW9HOHN5b3FXRVNUczlyX2RoSjhfdHpJVHhsZk44Q2RKbi12VkRQR1VIelJKMmpGZmJzX3JVV1BF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPbHE4VmRvQ09mNE92WWlYeVZFOURuSlNkM0xldmxUMER2QTNnaGFRdlJmZDU3X2w4RDJSdTFvdzVkakticUVWU0o4SnVvMkxZRC1HVXQ5SlpmWUE4S1F1WUNEenFMU1IwXzRGMjFMSjJTblBlaE5Wd25xaHJPNWgzSmhkRkY3UjJDRDRkanhsVkpPWTRtZjJITlV4Rl9OelZKeDZpSEhmR2p2STJEWWFXYS10TnlLNjJvNU5NN2Z3TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPYnp3MkNGRS1sTktySHRxMlRhMy1lN045bExIcGV5STM4WUR3NEowYUNXOExxbGNCcEVVQlAyY2NCM192TGZib3ZYTjROSmRwYTQ4cDR2STVwU0N4VGN1TDZfN1o2Q2FSeHBsRFBRMXpuSXI5WU4ydXBtc01mZURFaGQtVFUwMWhOSXpNdDZZTUFnRlBBYkxwb1k4WXI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: